      "question": "The LB840 Funds schedule (p10) is a sub-fund reported inside the General Fund (restricted economic development 2,982,415 in the General Fund column, p3). Is it already included in the budget-basis General Fund schedule (p5)? If so, its three detail lines (investment income 89,605, economic development 13,508, transfers 750,000) double count and should be dropped.",
